# Lampose Tracker — environment variables
# Copy to `.env` and fill in your own values. `.env` is gitignored.

# Backend API base URL — just the origin. No trailing slash, no /api suffix:
# every call in services/ already builds the full path itself (e.g.
# "/api/v2/sales/auth/login"), so an /api here would double up on every
# request. The one Lampose backend listens on 5001 by default (check
# Backend/.env's PORT — it's overridden to 8026 in this project's setup).
#
# "localhost" only works from an iOS simulator. An Android emulator needs
# 10.0.2.2 in place of localhost; a real phone (Expo Go) needs this computer's
# actual LAN IP, which changes on some networks — if you start getting
# "Network request failed" after this worked before, check that IP first.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:5001
